    <string name="step_pointing">%1$s: every spot for %2$d is in %3$s, so %2$d can\'t go anywhere else in %3$s.</string>
    <string name="step_claiming">%1$s: every spot for %2$d is inside %3$s, so %2$d can\'t go anywhere else in %3$s.</string>
    <string name="step_naked_pair">%1$s: two cells can only be %2$d or %3$d, so no other cell there can be %2$d or %3$d.</string>
    <string name="step_naked_triple">%1$s: three cells can only be %2$d, %3$d or %4$d, so no other cell there can be one of them.</string>
    <string name="step_hidden_pair">%1$s: %2$d and %3$d fit only in the same two cells, so those cells can\'t be anything else.</string>
    <string name="step_hidden_triple">%1$s: %2$d, %3$d and %4$d fit only in the same three cells, so those cells can\'t be anything else.</string>
    <string name="step_x_wing_rows">In rows %1$d and %2$d, %3$d fits only in columns %4$d and %5$d, so %3$d can\'t go anywhere else in those columns.</string>
    <string name="step_x_wing_columns">In columns %1$d and %2$d, %3$d fits only in rows %4$d and %5$d, so %3$d can\'t go anywhere else in those rows.</string>
    <string name="step_swordfish_rows">In rows %1$d, %2$d and %3$d, %4$d fits only in columns %5$d, %6$d and %7$d, so %4$d can\'t go anywhere else in those columns.</string>
    <string name="step_swordfish_columns">In columns %1$d, %2$d and %3$d, %4$d fits only in rows %5$d, %6$d and %7$d, so %4$d can\'t go anywhere else in those rows.</string>
    <string name="step_xy_wing">A cell that can only be %1$d or %2$d sees one cell that is %1$d or %3$d, and another that is %2$d or %3$d. Either way, one of those two is %3$d, so %3$d can\'t go in any cell that sees both.</string>
    <string name="hint_then_naked_single">That leaves only %1$d for the highlighted cell.</string>
    <string name="hint_then_hidden_single">That leaves only one spot for %1$d in %2$s: the highlighted cell.</string>
